intro:
  heading: "Comprehensive Commercial Site Preparation & Earthmoving"
  paragraphs:
    - >
      S. Phaneuf & Associates is a leading commercial excavation contractor providing complete site preparation, earthmoving, foundation digging, and stormwater management throughout Massachusetts. We serve commercial developers, general contractors, municipal projects, and residential estate builds.
    - >
      Our heavy civil site work includes multi-acre land clearing, stump grubbing, cut-and-fill grading, underground utility trenching (water, sewer, electric), foundation footing excavation, catch basin drainage, and subgrade compaction.
    - >
      With over 35 years of earthmoving expertise, S. Phaneuf & Associates self-performs every phase of site development from initial clearing through final asphalt paving.


